  <section id="desktop-features" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Desktop feature folders</h2>
    <p>Each folder under <code>apps/desktop/src/features/</code> owns one product area's components, state and API calls:</p>
    <DocCode language="text" title="apps/desktop/src/features/">
{"admin  ai  analytics  auth  billing  cad  cam  chat  companion  costs  dashboard\nlegal  library  marketplace  mcp  organizations  plugins  profile  projects  settings  toolpaths"}
    </DocCode>
    <p>A feature calls the sidecar through the shared API client; shared widgets live in <code>shared/</code> and the 3D scene in <code>viewport/</code>.</p>
